WEBVTT

1
00:00:14.600 --> 00:00:19.062
school Ben collected some books for homework from his locker and headed outside.

2
00:00:23.385 --> 00:00:23.945
wrong, Ben?"

3
00:00:24.285 --> 00:00:25.066
Waldo called.

4
00:00:25.086 --> 00:00:28.868
"You look so glum."

5
00:00:31.836 --> 00:00:34.678
Ben told him about his lunchtime conversation with Winnie.

6
00:00:34.698 --> 00:00:41.443
"I'm glad she's enjoying the circus, but I'm getting a little tired of all the secrets."

7
00:00:42.884 --> 00:00:44.725
"I know what you mean," Waldo said.

8
00:00:44.745 --> 00:00:49.549
"The show will be fun," Ben went on, "but—oof!"

9
00:00:49.889 --> 00:00:52.971
Cleo had slammed into Ben, knocking him to the ground.

10
00:00:52.991 --> 00:00:54.192
"Sorry, Ben!"

11
00:00:54.552 --> 00:00:55.033
she said.

12
00:00:55.053 --> 00:00:59.536
"I was on the field for gym class, and I'm running late for circus practice.

13
00:00:59.936 --> 00:01:01.957
We can't miss a single minute of it!"

14
00:01:03.098 --> 00:01:04.319
Waldo scratched his head.

15
00:01:04.339 --> 00:01:06.781
"How much could you really miss in just one minute?"

16
00:01:06.801 --> 00:01:08.902
"There's a lot to learn!"

17
00:01:09.282 --> 00:01:11.984
Cleo said as Ben got up and dusted himself off.

18
00:01:12.004 --> 00:01:16.587
"You guys aren't performers so you probably wouldn't understand."

19
00:01:16.607 --> 00:01:18.509
"Come on, Cleo!"

20
00:01:18.849 --> 00:01:20.710
Ben burst out, exasperated.

21
00:01:20.730 --> 00:01:24.192
"It's not like our heads are filled with sludge or anything."

22
00:01:25.233 --> 00:01:26.814
Cleo instantly stiffened.

23
00:01:26.834 --> 00:01:30.224
"Cleo?" Ben said.

24
00:01:30.244 --> 00:01:31.885
"Are you okay?

25
00:01:32.245 --> 00:01:33.385
Did I say something wrong?"

26
00:01:34.305 --> 00:01:35.546
Cleo didn't say a word.

27
00:01:35.966 --> 00:01:39.347
Instead she turned to Waldo and grabbed him by the waist.

28
00:01:39.867 --> 00:01:45.408
Then to Ben's astonishment, she lifted Waldo into the air and began twirling him on her finger.

29
00:01:45.428 --> 00:01:49.769
"Ahh!" Waldo cried, his face turning a sickly green.

30
00:01:49.789 --> 00:01:51.530
"Put me down, Cleo!

31
00:01:51.850 --> 00:01:53.150
I'm going to be sick!"

32
00:01:53.830 --> 00:01:59.172
"Cleo!" Sarah Swingwire suddenly rushed toward them, nervously snapping her gum.

33
00:01:59.692 --> 00:02:01.874
"Put that wizard down and go to practice!

34
00:02:02.154 --> 00:02:03.195
You're already late!"

35
00:02:03.815 --> 00:02:06.677
Cleo set Waldo down as quickly as she had lifted him.

36
00:02:07.097 --> 00:02:09.199
Then she turned and hurried into the building.

37
00:02:09.219 --> 00:02:15.023
"You monsters are such mysterious creatures!"

38
00:02:15.623 --> 00:02:16.263
Sarah said.

39
00:02:16.283 --> 00:02:19.806
"I had no idea the training would be so challenging.

40
00:02:20.206 --> 00:02:21.347
Have you seen Mr.

41
00:02:21.407 --> 00:02:23.629
Scribblebottom? I need to give him a message."

42
00:02:24.609 --> 00:02:28.412
Ben pointed to the filmmaker, who was hurrying toward them with his camera.

43
00:02:28.804 --> 00:02:30.445
"Sarah!" he called.

44
00:02:30.465 --> 00:02:32.765
"I'm here to film today's practice.

45
00:02:33.105 --> 00:02:34.106
Has it started yet?"

46
00:02:34.966 --> 00:02:35.846
Sarah flushed.

47
00:02:35.866 --> 00:02:37.626
"I'm sorry, Mr.

48
00:02:37.686 --> 00:02:41.628
Scribblebottom, but you won't be able to film today's session after all.

49
00:02:42.068 --> 00:02:43.268
Maybe another day though."

50
00:02:43.288 --> 00:02:46.829
"But The filmmaker looked confused.

51
00:02:47.369 --> 00:02:49.710
"There are only two days of practice left.

52
00:02:50.130 --> 00:02:51.470
And Ronny said it would be fine."

53
00:02:51.490 --> 00:02:57.772
"Unfortunately, things have changed because there's so much work to do before the show."

54
00:02:58.760 --> 00:03:02.543
Mr. Scribblebottom let out a frustrated groan as Sarah hurried off.

55
00:03:02.563 --> 00:03:07.006
"How am I supposed to make a movie when I'm not even allowed in the practice session?"

56
00:03:07.326 --> 00:03:07.846
he muttered.

57
00:03:10.047 --> 00:03:12.189
Ben watched Waldo stagger to his feet.

58
00:03:12.209 --> 00:03:20.534
"Is it me, Waldo," Ben asked slowly, "or do you also get the feeling that there's something weird

59
00:03:20.594 --> 00:03:22.856
about this traveling circus school?"

60
00:03:24.004 --> 00:03:29.369
"Maybe I Waldo tried to take a step, but he pitched forward instead.

61
00:03:29.389 --> 00:03:32.891
"Waldo!" Gaby rushed over with Jen.

62
00:03:32.912 --> 00:03:35.193
"Are you okay?"

63
00:03:35.213 --> 00:03:39.077
"I'm fine," Waldo said.

64
00:03:39.097 --> 00:03:40.638
"Just a little dizzy."

65
00:03:40.658 --> 00:03:44.901
"Cleo spun him on her finger," Ben said.

66
00:03:44.921 --> 00:03:47.283
"Huh?" Gaby cried.

67
00:03:47.303 --> 00:03:50.005
"What in the world is going on around here?

68
00:03:50.446 --> 00:03:52.608
Everyone's acting so weird lately."

69
00:03:53.792 --> 00:03:54.553
Jen nodded.

70
00:03:54.573 --> 00:03:56.474
"And secretive!"

71
00:03:57.274 --> 00:03:58.335
Ben had been thinking.

72
00:03:58.355 --> 00:04:01.897
"Maybe it's time to do some investigating."

73
00:04:01.917 --> 00:04:03.918
"What do you mean?"

74
00:04:04.258 --> 00:04:05.039
Jen asked.

75
00:04:05.059 --> 00:04:09.161
"I mean, we should spy on the circus practice," Ben said.

76
00:04:09.181 --> 00:04:14.164
"Uh Waldo shook his head before realizing that it made him dizzy.

77
00:04:14.184 --> 00:04:17.646
"That does not sound like a good idea.

78
00:04:18.606 --> 00:04:20.968
The circus practice is closed, remember?"

79
00:04:22.088 --> 00:04:23.969
"Well, I think it's a great idea!"

80
00:04:24.230 --> 00:04:24.950
Gaby said.

81
00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:28.152
"You could have gotten seriously hurt, Waldo.

82
00:04:29.093 --> 00:04:31.755
And spying would be easy—for Ben."

83
00:04:31.775 --> 00:04:34.376
"Huh?" Ben said.

84
00:04:34.396 --> 00:04:36.878
"Me?" Gaby nodded.

85
00:04:36.898 --> 00:04:40.481
"You can just float up to the gym windows and watch from there."

86
00:04:40.501 --> 00:04:43.322
"Perfect!" Ben said.

87
00:04:43.342 --> 00:04:46.365
"I don't know," Jen said.

88
00:04:46.385 --> 00:04:50.087
"It doesn't seem—" "It's already decided," Gaby said.

89
00:04:50.107 --> 00:04:51.128
"Follow me."

90
00:04:52.528 --> 00:04:55.569
A few minutes later, the four of them were outside the gym.

91
00:04:56.090 --> 00:04:58.731
Ben floated up and peeked through one of the windows.

92
00:04:59.331 --> 00:05:03.072
In the room, ladders stood from a high wire and trapeze bar.

93
00:05:03.913 --> 00:05:10.115
Winnie was standing on the trapeze platform, staring straight ahead, and Deb hung upside down from a bar

94
00:05:10.175 --> 00:05:10.915
by her knees.

95
00:05:12.016 --> 00:05:19.039
Maddy was onstage, calmly juggling slime balls, while Mog tried to stuff himself into a large cannon.

96
00:05:19.659 --> 00:05:23.881
And Cleo was walking around on stilts as Ringmaster Ronny watched.

97
00:05:24.962 --> 00:05:28.765
"Things look pretty normal to me," Ben called softly to his friends.

98
00:05:28.785 --> 00:05:33.949
"I mean, I don't know what normal is for a traveling circus from People Place, but I don't

99
00:05:33.989 --> 00:05:34.809
see anything odd."

100
00:05:34.829 --> 00:05:37.231
"Great," Jen said.

101
00:05:37.251 --> 00:05:39.453
"Let's go before you get caught."

102
00:05:40.113 --> 00:05:42.215
Ben ignored her and went back to watching.

103
00:05:42.235 --> 00:05:46.418
"Cool! Zork is starting to walk across the high wire."

104
00:05:46.438 --> 00:05:48.339
"Are you kidding?"

105
00:05:48.719 --> 00:05:49.300
Gaby said.

106
00:05:50.088 --> 00:05:54.377
"At the high-wire station yesterday, Zork told me he was afraid of heights."

107
00:05:55.199 --> 00:05:57.363
Suddenly Zork's foot slipped.

108
00:05:58.285 --> 00:05:59.146
Ben gasped.

109
00:05:59.166 --> 00:06:00.830
"Zork's falling off the wire!"
